    \u0E09\u0E1A\u0E31\u0E1A\u0E41\u0E23\u0E01"
  mailShopLevel: 1
  mailReputation: 320
  chef: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4ca161307a19ab499b5d49387c6380d, type: 2}
  letterBody: 'Hey there!


    Name''s Dan. I run a diner off Route 9, been flipping
    burgers for twenty-two years. My daughter found your place online and said, "Dad,
    this kid''s doing what you did." So here I am, writing a letter like it''s 1985.


    Before
    the diner I drove trucks. Lonely work. The best part of any day was a cheeseburger
    at some roadside joint where nobody asked me questions.


    Smash the beef
    thin on a hot griddle, cheese on right after the flip, toast the bun. Lettuce,
    tomato, pickles. Don''t overthink it.'
